#: src/vcf_generator_lite/ui/windows/main_window/layout.py:33
msgctxt "window_main.label_usage"
msgid ""
"Instructions:\n"
"1. Copy names and phone numbers in the format \"Name Phone Notes\" (notes optional) into the edit box below.\n"
"2. Click \"Generate\" and select a path to save the file.\n"
"3. You can use the generated vCard file wherever you need it, such as importing it into your phone or email."
msgstr ""
"使用说明：\n"
"1. 把名字和电话以每行“姓名 电话 备注”（备注可忽略）的格式复制到下面的编辑框内。\n"
"2. 点击“生成”，选择一个路径保存文件。\n"
"3. 您可以将生成后的 vCard 文件用在您需要的地方，例如导入到手机或者邮箱。"

